     *   'mic_i'  Intermediate reference text ("-" means not defined)
     *   'mic_r'  Resistant reference text
     *   's'      numeric Susceptible threshold (float) — "MIC ≤ s" ⇒ S
     *   'r'      numeric Resistant threshold (float)   — "MIC ≥ r" ⇒ R
